# Source manifest: {{COURSE}} {{EXAM}}

One row per source file. **These rows are the one statement of scope:** `CLAUDE.md` and
`PLAN.md` point here and never restate it. A scope change is made here, then carried to every
product (the notes' "Not on {{EXAM}}" banners, the sheets, the cram order and its mock lines).
Counts come from disk (`pdfinfo`, `ls`), never from memory.

- Received: {{YYYY-MM-DD}}, from {{WHERE}}, selected by file name.
- Renders: `_build/pages/<doc>/p-NNN.png` and `_build/text/<doc>/p-NNN.txt` (gitignored).
- Originals: {{kept at WHERE | deleted YYYY-MM-DD after a SHA-256 match; `sources/` is the only copy}}.

